#: ../../library/json.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`json` --- JSON encoding and decoding"
msgstr ":mod:`json` --- JSON kodiranje i dekodiranje"

#: ../../library/json.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module converts between Python objects and the JSON data format.  Use "
":func:`dumps`/:func:`loads` to (de)serialise to or from a string, or "
":func:`dump`/:func:`load` to read or write JSON from a stream such as a file"
" or socket."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul pretvara između Python objekata i JSON formata podataka. "
"Upotrijebite :func:`dumps`\\ /\\ :func:`loads` za (de)serijalizaciju u "
"string ili iz njega, ili :func:`dump`\\ /\\ :func:`load` za čitanje ili "
"pisanje JSON-a iz toka kao što je datoteka ili socket."

#: ../../library/json.rst:13
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/json.rst:17
msgid "Serialise *obj* to a JSON string, writing it to the given *stream*."
msgstr "Serijalizira *obj* u JSON string, zapisujući ga u zadani *stream*\\ ."

#: ../../library/json.rst:19
msgid ""
"If specified, separators should be an ``(item_separator, key_separator)`` "
"tuple. The default is ``(', ', ': ')``. To get the most compact JSON "
"representation, you should specify ``(',', ':')`` to eliminate whitespace."
msgstr ""
"Ako je zadano, separators bi trebao biti ``(item_separator, key_separator)``"
" n-torka. Zadana vrijednost je ``(', ', ': ')``\\ . Za najsažetiji JSON "
"prikaz trebali biste zadati ``(',', ':')`` kako biste uklonili razmake."

#: ../../library/json.rst:25
msgid "Return *obj* represented as a JSON string."
msgstr "Vraća *obj* prikazan kao JSON string."

#: ../../library/json.rst:27
msgid "The arguments have the same meaning as in :func:`dump`."
msgstr "Argumenti imaju isto značenje kao u :func:`dump`\\ ."

#: ../../library/json.rst:31
msgid ""
"Parse the given *stream*, interpreting it as a JSON string and deserialising"
" the data to a Python object.  The resulting object is returned."
msgstr ""
"Parsira zadani *stream*\\ , tumačeći ga kao JSON string i deserijalizirajući"
" podatke u Python objekt. Vraća se rezultirajući objekt."

#: ../../library/json.rst:35
msgid ""
"Parsing continues until end-of-file is encountered. A :exc:`ValueError` is "
"raised if the data in *stream* is not correctly formed."
msgstr ""
"Parsiranje se nastavlja dok se ne naiđe na kraj datoteke. Podiže se "
":exc:`ValueError` ako podaci u *stream* nisu ispravno oblikovani."

#: ../../library/json.rst:40
msgid ""
"Parse the JSON *str* and return an object.  Raises :exc:`ValueError` if the "
"string is not correctly formed."
msgstr ""
"Parsira JSON *str* i vraća objekt. Podiže :exc:`ValueError` ako string nije "
"ispravno oblikovan."
